{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "23cec62a-1ed0-59ec-9a7b-38a6e49af3c5", "source_ordinal": 1558, "reading_ordinal": 2499, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "新手计划", "published_at": "2024-06-02T04:35:41+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/836c441e205611efb2af52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "从人的正常成长轨迹来讲，除非发生“一代目暴亡，二代目冲龄即位”这类极端事件，否则一般人都不会在没有足够经验时被赋予制定复杂计划的权力。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 67}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "你都没干过，我是上级，我是不太可能让你去从制定计划开始去负责一个如此陌生的工作的。硬赶着你上架的话，我一定做好了你会犯低级错误、彻底砸锅、没有产出任何有效成果的准备，这肯定是形格势禁，已经死马当成活马医、有枣没枣打三杆子的局面了，那么反正最多就是输，不如让替补球员上场体验体验。", "char_start": 68, "char_end": 207}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这时候你根本没必要过于执着追求制定“有效的行动计划”。", "char_start": 208, "char_end": 235}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "坦率讲，你没有过实践经验，根本不可能无师自通的确认何谓有效何谓无效，你要换一个方向，去制定一个理论上逻辑通顺，可以明确的执行，以至于可以有效总结的方案。", "char_start": 236, "char_end": 312}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "举个实际的例子：比如你突然被安排当足球主教练，这之前你甚至都不太看足球，也就刚明白足球的基本规则，你立刻就要制定一个计划去开打，你要怎么办？", "char_start": 313, "char_end": 383}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你首先要有一条理论上可行的计划。譬如——“所有人都往离球门最近的队友处传球，最接近球门的这个负责射门。如果在这期间有人跑到你前头去了，那么按照这个策略，你就要传球。”", "char_start": 384, "char_end": 467}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这个计划显然极其的初级和业余，但是你注意——它满足了两个条件。", "char_start": 468, "char_end": 499}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "1）它在数学逻辑上是通顺的。它逻辑清晰的指向“一群人合作将球踢进球门”这个结果。它很显然的有一定的逻辑可行性，而不是从逻辑上都无法成立。", "char_start": 500, "char_end": 568}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "例如你把战术改成“尽快传给五米以内离你最近的队友”，那么这个策略在数学上就不能保证球会被踢进对方球门，它完全可能陷入一个三角僵局，即在三个队员之间传一万脚，连中线都不过。", "char_start": 569, "char_end": 654}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "2）它是否被严格执行了，是很容易被检查的。例如你直接全程录像，那么你就可以通过回放录像清晰的看到第几分第几秒的哪一脚传球或者射门是违背这个基本战略规则的。", "char_start": 655, "char_end": 732}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "因为你的计划本身是非常清晰的，所以偏离计划也会是非常分明的。而一旦发生这种事件，你就会立刻捕获一个定义明确的意外状况、一个确切的异常。", "char_start": 733, "char_end": 800}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "不管你是分析它发生的原理，还是分析它发生的方向，还是观察它的影响，你都可以对你原有的那个数学逻辑分明的计划打一个新的规范的补丁——例如添加一个“如果你无法有效观察前方，则传给你身后最近的队友，从他脚下重新启动，沿着先前的方针推进”，你的计划就得到了加强。", "char_start": 801, "char_end": 928}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "而这样做的好处是什么呢？", "char_start": 929, "char_end": 941}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "1）鉴于你制订的原始计划在数学上是显然成立的，你已经不会得到“完全没有有效思路”的评价。", "char_start": 942, "char_end": 986}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "2）鉴于你给出的策略规则非常容易分明的确定谁在什么时候偏离了执行要求，你很容易摆脱“管理不善”的评价。", "char_start": 987, "char_end": 1038}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "谁违规，谁负责，你作为主事人其实不能做到没人有机会违规——死刑都拦不住人犯罪，你又不是万磁王，你哪能按住每一只乱动的手？——只要你能做到一旦发生计划偏离，你就能定位时间、地点、人物、剧情，你的管理职能就很容易承担。", "char_start": 1039, "char_end": 1146}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "3）鉴于对计划到底是怎么失败的，如何进一步改进该计划思路，你可以基于原有的逻辑通顺的计划去提出更具有健壮性的计划，你就免于了“没有成长空间”的评价。", "char_start": 1147, "char_end": 1221}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "而你如果能满足这三个要求，即上手就有思路、出问题知道出在哪、看到问题后能提出进一步的有效思路，那么作为一个明知没有经验的新人，不管你这计划最后结果如何，你都会得到特殊的高评价。", "char_start": 1222, "char_end": 1310}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "为什么呢？", "char_start": 1311, "char_end": 1316}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "因为你即使没有获得成功，但你良好的、有系统的尝试，有效的改善了组织对该挑战的战术位置。", "char_start": 1317, "char_end": 1360}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "就像你就算没拿下这个山头，但你已经严谨的尝试了一种可能行得通的战术，并且在撤下来的时候，你告诉了继任者你这个计划在哪里遇到了什么问题导致了受阻。", "char_start": 1361, "char_end": 1433}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "你后面的人就不是从0起点去对付这个问题。", "char_start": 1434, "char_end": 1454}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "你把整个组织对付这个问题的起点抬高了，这是有效的贡献，甚至是作为毫无经验的开拓者所能做到的最大的贡献。", "char_start": 1455, "char_end": 1506}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "而实际上你仔细观察，就会发现“所有人都往离球门最近的队友处传球，最接近球门的这个负责射门。如果在这期间有人跑到你前头去了，那么按照这个策略，你就要传球”本身就是一种SOP体系。", "char_start": 1507, "char_end": 1595}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "在这个体系的每个节点上都有清晰的输入和输出，明确的条件控制规则，全是SOP，发现没有？", "char_start": 1596, "char_end": 1639}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "其实这些SOP是不可靠的、是你无法知道是否足够有效的，但这不重要，此时“理论上有值得尝试的价值、而且从执行中能得到有意义的经验教训”已经替代了“足够有效”，解决了你的问题。", "char_start": 1640, "char_end": 1726}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "你没有“足够有效的行动计划”，你有“胜算不为零，而且能产生经验教训的计划”就够了，而且是你能追求的极限了。", "char_start": 1727, "char_end": 1780}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "你只是要避免那种连理论上都没有确切的成功路线、没有有效方法判断计划何时何地被偏离、无法改变针对问题的战术位置的计划。", "char_start": 1781, "char_end": 1839}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "这并不那么困难。", "char_start": 1840, "char_end": 1848}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 29}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0367"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：涉足新领域时，如何在尚无足够sop“砖块”积累情况下，制定一个有效的行动计划？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029"], "summary": "围绕“新手计划”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“从人的正常成长轨迹来讲，除非发生“一代目暴亡，二代目冲龄即位”这类极端事件，否则一般人都不会在没有足够经验时被赋予制定复杂计划的权力。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "从人的正常成长轨迹来讲，除非发生“一代目暴亡，二代目冲龄即位”这类极端事件，否则一般人都不会在没有足够经验时被赋予制定复杂计划的权力。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 67, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "16126b72-a5b9-5349-b824-e1bb45a63ac8", "source_ordinal": 1557, "reading_ordinal": 2500, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "好错", "published_at": "2024-06-03T04:24:29+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/648283158/answer/3518255244"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "你们没有发现吗？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "“害怕犯错误”是犯错误的资格的一部分。", "char_start": 9, "char_end": 28}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "一个害怕犯错误的人犯了错误，天然的容易得到原谅，因为仅仅“害怕犯错误”这一条，已经保证了ta犯错误不会是故意的，保证了ta犯的一定是能力的错误、方法的错误，而非态度的错误、意愿的错误。", "char_start": 29, "char_end": 121}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "“害怕犯错误”是一张从轻处罚卡。", "char_start": 122, "char_end": 138}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "而一个自称不怕犯错误的人，一旦犯了错误，很自然的会导致人们想要从重处罚ta，不仅仅针对ta错误造成的损失，而且还要额外加重处罚，制裁ta这种傲慢而不负责任的态度。", "char_start": 139, "char_end": 220}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "仅仅一个“我不怕犯错误”的态度，本身就是对可能受错误牵连的所有人的漠视和抛弃。", "char_start": 221, "char_end": 260}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "而人是社会的动物，所有人都会受到所有人的牵连。", "char_start": 261, "char_end": 284}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你被扣了工资，你家里人就会跟着受穷；你搞砸了丢单子，你的同事也要跟着丢奖金；就算你自己是老板，你犯错误，员工也要丢工作。", "char_start": 285, "char_end": 345}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你鼓吹不怕犯错误，就等于鼓吹不怕导致ta们受穷、扣钱、丢工作，你想想，是人话吗？ta们能容吗？旁人看得过眼吗？", "char_start": 346, "char_end": 401}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "所以，最少最少，不管你是不是真的不怕犯错误，“不怕犯错误”这话你都说不得，当着谁你都说不得——说了就是在诅咒自己，给自己的电椅加流量包。", "char_start": 402, "char_end": 470}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "现在问题来了，那么“大胆的犯错误”是不是一句骗你送死的空话、假话？一种毫无意义的鼓励？为啥你的老板、上司、老师、父母、配偶……又老在这么撺掇你？", "char_start": 471, "char_end": 543}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "ta们这是要坑死你吗？", "char_start": 544, "char_end": 555}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "当然不是，那只是ta们没把话说全——大胆去犯比啥都不干要强的错误。", "char_start": 556, "char_end": 589}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "屁股后面坦克在追，你在前头管方向盘，往左还是往右，你很怕拐错弯，你站在路口挠头，这时候全车人都喊——大胆的犯错误！", "char_start": 590, "char_end": 647}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "因为你再不大胆的犯错误，你连犯错误的机会都没了。", "char_start": 648, "char_end": 672}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "一张考试卷，你生怕写了又擦搞得乌七八糟，趴在那转笔抖腿，班主任抱个茶杯站你身边，“同学们不要怕，大胆的犯错误”——ta意思是你交白卷比交花卷是更大的错误。", "char_start": 673, "char_end": 750}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "受到鼓励、宽容你去大胆犯下的，并不是随便什么错——比如你既不往左转，也不往右转，而是原地倒车，你看乘客们打不打得死你？你不选A、不选B，你选放下武器，你看班主任骂不骂你？", "char_start": 751, "char_end": 836}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "人们鼓励你去犯的是好过不作为且凭你的能力能犯的最高质量的错误。", "char_start": 837, "char_end": 868}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "看清楚这两个边界：下边界，“好于不作为”；上边界，“质量尽量高”。", "char_start": 869, "char_end": 902}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "这两条界线之内，就是“错误安全区”。超出下边界，就开始免除责任；到达上边界，责任全免。", "char_start": 903, "char_end": 946}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "错误带来的惩罚是错误生产教训的成本。", "char_start": 947, "char_end": 965}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "这就意味着，在这个圈内的错误所凝结成的经验和教训，其成本会格外的低。", "char_start": 966, "char_end": 1000}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "捡到就是赚到。", "char_start": 1001, "char_end": 1008}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "要是你聪明到能极其巧妙的只犯这个安全区内的错误，你就会变得“不怕犯错误”。", "char_start": 1009, "char_end": 1046}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "因为你在捡钱——谁会怕捡钱？", "char_start": 1047, "char_end": 1061}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "那要怎么做到只犯这种肥美的好错误呢？", "char_start": 1062, "char_end": 1080}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "用这个句式来检查——“我害怕犯错误，我也知道这样选择有ABCD风险，但不这样选择有EFGH风险，而不选择直接死定”。", "char_start": 1081, "char_end": 1139}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "抬头一句“害怕犯错误”，先干为敬；", "char_start": 1140, "char_end": 1157}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "第二句“ABCDEFGH”你写得越全、算得越仔细，你越接近上限，赚得越多；", "char_start": 1158, "char_end": 1195}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "第三句“不选直接死定”，免费保释。", "char_start": 1196, "char_end": 1213}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "这句绝不能写成“我知道这样选择有ABCD风险，但我不怕犯错误”——病成这样，得电。", "char_start": 1214, "char_end": 1255}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 32}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0367"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：既然我们能从错误中吸取教训和经验，为什么我们还是「害怕犯错误」？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031"], "summary": "围绕“好错”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“你们没有发现吗？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "你们没有发现吗？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "c073359f-ce17-59ba-9026-dfef7edf8ca4", "source_ordinal": 1556, "reading_ordinal": 2501, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "素问", "published_at": "2024-06-03T21:52:53+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/539240374/answer/3519154636"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "实际上，素问（sooon.ai）的一大目标，是为了帮助它的用户解决这个“如何在不过度暴露隐私信息的前提下帮助人了解我的价值观和伦理观”的问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 71}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "基本做法是这样的：", "char_start": 72, "char_end": 81}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "1）你将凭着在素问的活动获得一份长期的活动记录。这些活动记录包括于何时询问过素问什么问题、发起过哪些同问、参与过哪些同问、在特定月份达到了多高的采纳率、做出了多少贡献值。", "char_start": 82, "char_end": 167}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "素问的活动记录因为我的规则管理是根本无法短期速成的，你只能每天花上几分钟的点滴积累、逐月沉淀。", "char_start": 168, "char_end": 215}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "将来你只要把这份贡献记录分享给知道素问的人看，ta们就能非常简单地、然而是确实有效地了解你对什么很关注、你有过什么疑惑、你的心路历程。这份贡献记录可以权威性地证明你的公益精神和对伦理问题的长期关注以及严谨态度。", "char_start": 216, "char_end": 321}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "2）你将通过素问获得强大的内容整理工具，帮助你按照你自己关心的主题来重新组织素问的内容。譬如，你可以按照“个人修炼”主题，自己选择若干篇答案，为每一篇撰写自己的短评（短评本身发表在其他公开站点上、素问仅接受这些发表后文章的链接），制作出你自己的个人阅读记录 / 导读建议。这些基于我的公开内容和你自己的公开评论、进行过再排序、再组合的“导读文集”，本身就体现了你自己对这个中心议题的全面的、细致的、确切的观点。而其本质上是一长串内容和评论的链接串，你将可以轻松地一键导出成格式化文本，随意按你自己的需求去其它平台公开发表。", "char_start": 322, "char_end": 583}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这些“读书笔记”“导读编册”，将会成为你自己伦理观的最直观表达。", "char_start": 584, "char_end": 616}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "注意，这并不需要你去赞同我这些答案，你大可以每一篇导读都写“我对其中的xxx观点有以下不同意见”。", "char_start": 617, "char_end": 666}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这样看了你的笔记的人自然就知道原文是什么而你有何不同意见。由于你的意见是发表在其他平台，很可能在你的创作下还会有你和你的读者的进一步讨论。", "char_start": 667, "char_end": 736}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "很多人都有“我想要系统通读但啃不下来 / 读完之后就基本忘了”的问题。借助这个工具你可以这么做：", "char_start": 737, "char_end": 785}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "1）首先建立一个文集，例如叫“亲密关系 （第一轮）”。", "char_start": 786, "char_end": 813}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "2）就利用素问去匹配你感兴趣的若干答案。一次性将有兴趣的答案都放进这个文集。", "char_start": 814, "char_end": 852}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "3）根据感兴趣的逻辑（这一般是一个追问关系），将所有收录的内容按照“最好先读这些再读这些”的原则进行排序。", "char_start": 853, "char_end": 906}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "3）然后逐篇阅读。每读一篇，就针对一篇写一个评论或者总结（譬如可以写在语雀上，微博上）然后将这个内容链接附加在这篇答案上。", "char_start": 907, "char_end": 968}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "循环往复，直到文集内所有的答案都有了评论链接，这就可以确保这个主题的确看过了。这一方面可以帮助你如愿深入、系统地阅读，与此同时，又一石二鸟地为你的后代、朋友、读者独辟了由你标识的道路。", "char_start": 969, "char_end": 1061}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "没有什么比这些笔记更能向人说明你的是非观、价值观、见识水平以及你的公共服务精神。", "char_start": 1062, "char_end": 1102}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "然而这些笔记却没有暴露你任何的个人身份和财务信息。", "char_start": 1103, "char_end": 1128}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "因为“不承担任何社交属性”是素问的基本准则——即默认情况下，a) 一个用户将只能看到自己在素问做了些什么，而无法看到任何一个具体用户在素问上看了些什么。b)素问将不提供用户互相交流的通道、互相通信的手段。", "char_start": 1129, "char_end": 1231}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "因此无人能在你不主动向对方提供的前提下看见你的任何信息。即使看到，也将无法看到这些页面上的用户名是什么。而这一点，将从根本逻辑上保证你的贡献有无可辩驳的“无我”性。", "char_start": 1232, "char_end": 1314}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "这也是为什么素问的感谢信里会有那句“你的名字无人知晓”。", "char_start": 1315, "char_end": 1343}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "素问将仅仅对人证明两点：", "char_start": 1344, "char_end": 1356}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "1）这个页面所记录的这个无名氏做过这些贡献、ta关心和参与过这些问题，ta对这些答案做过这样的编纂工作，并且ta对这些有这样那样的看法。", "char_start": 1357, "char_end": 1425}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "2）能控制这个页面的人很可能就是这个人。（将提供鉴权手段）。", "char_start": 1426, "char_end": 1456}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "你是否愿意和这个人建立雇佣、合作、购买、社交、朋友、恋爱关系，这个凭证可以给你以下可供参考的重要依据——ta的伦理观念、服务精神和做事的恒心。", "char_start": 1457, "char_end": 1528}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "这虽然不是绝对可信的保证——世界上哪有绝对可信的保证呢——但它拥有三个要害：", "char_start": 1529, "char_end": 1567}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "1）完成它需要大量的时间和坚持，而**时间是个难以蒙混的要素。**哪怕你有一个亿，要在素问积累到这些贡献，也只能靠时间，没有捷径。", "char_start": 1568, "char_end": 1633}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "2）ta做这件事时，是没有确切可信的名利可求的。因为上面没有ta的名字。因此“一时之间没有名利”，并不会妨碍这个人去做ta认为有价值的事。", "char_start": 1634, "char_end": 1703}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "3）这个长期工作本身就是辛苦在自己、利益在大众的爱的付出。没有什么比爱的付出本身更能证明人对爱的坚持。", "char_start": 1704, "char_end": 1755}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "素问不同于其他的服务，它的规则将是非常“苛刻”和“不友善”的，但唯其如此，在素问的贡献才自带尊严。", "char_start": 1756, "char_end": 1805}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "无我之问，是为素问。", "char_start": 1807, "char_end": 1817}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "无我之答，即为素答。", "char_start": 1818, "char_end": 1828}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "祝你们平安。", "char_start": 1830, "char_end": 1836}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 35}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0367"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：怎么样才能让别人知道自己的价值观又不过多暴露真实的自我？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032"], "summary": "围绕“素问”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“实际上，素问（sooon.ai）的一大目标，是为了帮助它的用户解决这个“如何在不过度暴露隐私信息的前提下帮助人了解我的价值观和伦理观”的问题。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "实际上，素问（sooon.ai）的一大目标，是为了帮助它的用户解决这个“如何在不过度暴露隐私信息的前提下帮助人了解我的价值观和伦理观”的问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 71, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "bc3e4fcc-d641-5665-9a27-e751c9e03298", "source_ordinal": 1555, "reading_ordinal": 2502, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "傻强", "published_at": "2024-06-04T18:23:36+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/651409290/answer/3520107471"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "当然是实话实说，因为你撑不过去。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "主考官如果是合格的，你到底会不会并不难看出来。只要看出来你是不会装会，那你就死定了。", "char_start": 17, "char_end": 59}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "因为在工作中最可恨的愚蠢行为之一就是不会却装会。", "char_start": 60, "char_end": 84}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你明明不会开保险柜，你说会，大家点也踩了、脸也蒙了、枪也开了、保险库也炸了、丧彪都中枪了，傻强都挂了。", "char_start": 85, "char_end": 136}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你现在来说你是装的，其实你不会。", "char_start": 137, "char_end": 153}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "信不信丧彪一只手就掐死你？", "char_start": 154, "char_end": 167}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "一旦遇到了你不会的问题，这个问题就自动变成“当我遇到我不会的问题我会怎么办”的团队意识问题。", "char_start": 168, "char_end": 214}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "1）我肯定毫不隐瞒，立刻上报风险，帮助团队负责人掌握状况，把握解决风险的最佳机会。", "char_start": 215, "char_end": 256}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "2）我立刻提出我个人研究这个问题的思路和需要的时间和资源，供团队负责人综合考虑。", "char_start": 257, "char_end": 297}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "3）我立刻告知如果这项工作要转交ta人我可以做的配合。", "char_start": 298, "char_end": 325}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "4）在报告完毕之后，在主管做出决定之前，我会自动开始按照前面报告的思路着手研究这个问题，并按计划报告研究进度。", "char_start": 326, "char_end": 381}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "没人能保证知道所有必要的知识，如果有，那不是你可以通过“面试”这种方式去招纳的人物。", "char_start": 382, "char_end": 424}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "所以没有必要纠结“这个我不会”——不客气地讲，主考官如果合格，会一直问到你的盲区出现为止。因为ta们需要评估你遇到不会的地方是个什么人品、什么态度、会给出什么解决方案。", "char_start": 425, "char_end": 509}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这极为重要。", "char_start": 510, "char_end": 516}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "每次面试新人的时候，丧彪都会想起傻强。", "char_start": 517, "char_end": 536}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 15}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0367"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：面试被问到知识盲区，是直接说不清楚，还是说一些正确的废话？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015"], "summary": "围绕“傻强”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“当然是实话实说，因为你撑不过去。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "当然是实话实说，因为你撑不过去。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "9431ae64-eb29-507e-adab-b48408b558f0", "source_ordinal": 1554, "reading_ordinal": 2503, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "舒适禁区", "published_at": "2024-06-04T20:47:03+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/354223696/answer/3520211377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "走出舒适区，不是指“强迫自己做不喜欢的事”，而是指“不要只做自己确定喜欢的事”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 40}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "你喜欢吃饺子、不喜欢吃烙饼，这没什么问题。", "char_start": 41, "char_end": 62}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "问题是，花胶鸡你没吃过、干锅牛蛙你没吃过、炒蚕蛹你没吃过、土笋冻你没吃过。", "char_start": 63, "char_end": 100}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "走出舒适区，意思是你不该仅仅因为“它们不是饺子”就绝不尝一下。", "char_start": 101, "char_end": 132}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "“走不出舒适区”之所以成为一种问题，指的是你已经进入这样一种悲剧的状态——从此只吃你吃过且觉得好吃的东西，一切没吃过的，你一律假设不好吃。", "char_start": 133, "char_end": 202}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "所以只要叫你吃没吃过的，对你就自动等于叫你吃不好吃的。", "char_start": 203, "char_end": 230}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "所以你才会有这种“走出舒适区不就是逼我做我不喜欢的事吗”的困惑。", "char_start": 231, "char_end": 263}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "“所有我没试过的必然都是坏的”是不是个健康的状态？这个就得自己反思了。", "char_start": 264, "char_end": 299}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "八十岁这样想也罢了。", "char_start": 300, "char_end": 310}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "十八岁你也这样想，想死啊你？", "char_start": 311, "char_end": 325}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 11}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0367"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：走出舒适区就是强迫自己做自己不喜欢的事吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010"], "summary": "围绕“舒适禁区”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“走出舒适区，不是指“强迫自己做不喜欢的事”，而是指“不要只做自己确定喜欢的事”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "走出舒适区，不是指“强迫自己做不喜欢的事”，而是指“不要只做自己确定喜欢的事”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 40, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "5518187d-9a2f-5ad2-9aeb-9c5ba3ff343c", "source_ordinal": 1553, "reading_ordinal": 2504, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "维生素M", "published_at": "2024-06-05T03:56:32+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/ca874cf013a711f084b652540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这个问题问得实在太“巨大”，按理说不应该采纳的。它实际上应该被分解为至少四个问题，即“何谓责任”“如何分辨责任的归属”“怎样承担属于自己的责任”以及“如何更好的对子女进行上述教导”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 91}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "在这里关于前三个问题暂时全部都跳过，直接回答第四个问题。", "char_start": 92, "char_end": 120}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "所谓“跳过”，意思是父母暂时就按自己的理解去处理前三个问题，不必过度忧虑自己对这三个问题的理解和立场有多大的缺陷。", "char_start": 121, "char_end": 178}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "只要你是想要教子女去承担责任而不是教ta们无论如何都要想各种巧妙的办法逃避责任，那么你再错也只是战术问题、细节问题。真正搞错方向的人是不认可任何主动承担责任的行为的，觉得那都是白痴犯傻，所以也就没有这个“苦恼”可言了。", "char_start": 179, "char_end": 288}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "所以只要你在烦恼这个，你就不会太错。至于这三个基本问题本身，我们到那些问题被问的时候再说。", "char_start": 289, "char_end": 334}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "现在只谈一个更基本的问题——关于什么是责任、如何分辨归属、怎样承担，我都跟子女说了，但是感觉ta有听却没有懂、听了跟没听差不多，这怎么办？", "char_start": 335, "char_end": 404}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "有一个工具，父母们往往没怎么好好地用，那就是纪念。", "char_start": 405, "char_end": 430}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "何谓纪念？", "char_start": 431, "char_end": 436}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "何谓“纪”？纺织要用丝线，而丝线在接入织机时，必须先找到线头，这个线头就叫“绪 / 头绪”，而丝线生产的时候很显然就有一个一般的处理——人们会拿一根绳子把一大把丝线的头绪扎在一起。", "char_start": 437, "char_end": 527}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这根扎住头绪的绳子，就叫做“纪”。“纪”也就是“一切开端的固定物”。", "char_start": 528, "char_end": 562}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这个概念极为重要，作为结果，在中国文化中大量的使用着纪字——例如“纪律”、“纪录”、“风纪”、“纪年”、“年纪”、“世纪”、“纪略”……", "char_start": 563, "char_end": 631}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "念，就是承认与回顾。", "char_start": 632, "char_end": 642}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "所谓纪念，就是在这件事的开头做一个郑重的、鲜明的记号，加以严肃的承认，并在之后不断的回顾、重申。", "char_start": 643, "char_end": 691}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "下面这句话你们要记住，记住了对于子女的包括你自己的人生幸福有至关重要的作用：", "char_start": 692, "char_end": 730}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "heading", "index": 15, "text": "人的存在感可以表达为纪念的总和。", "char_start": 731, "char_end": 747}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "人是存在的，这个只要人自己在呼吸、在接收身体感官传来的信号，人就可以自我察觉。但存在并不等于存在感，因为人的当下感知仅仅能证明当下的存在，而在人的生命之中，“当下”只是短期记忆所覆盖的短短几天，“过去”才是人生的主体。", "char_start": 748, "char_end": 857}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "“当下”永远只有七天，而过去是每过一天就多一天。人的年纪越大，“当下”在自己整个生命中就越是无足轻重。", "char_start": 858, "char_end": 909}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "虽然“当下”还能给我的整个生命增加一抹确定无疑的实质，但随着它的比例的下降，如果我的过去没有任何纪念，“我的存在”就会像一碗只加水不加米的粥，变的越来越透明。", "char_start": 910, "char_end": 989}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "如果人生没有足够的纪念，人就会发生存在感危机。人会将此表达为“我的生存有什么意义”这样深奥的形式。但本质上，人缺的不是人生意义本身，而是提炼人生意义的基础、人生意义的原矿——人生的纪念。", "char_start": 990, "char_end": 1083}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "其实只要拥有大量的纪念作为存在感的定锚，人完全可以仅仅把“没有找到人生意义”视为一个风雅的痛苦。人生意义问题在哲学上是一个思想问题，但在实践上却仅仅是一个缺少纪念的问题。", "char_start": 1084, "char_end": 1169}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "而问题在于，纪念却像维生素C，没有你活不了，但你自身合成不了——纪念必须来自他人的参与。", "char_start": 1170, "char_end": 1214}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "自己给自己过的生日是几乎没有效力的。", "char_start": 1215, "char_end": 1233}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "某种意义上讲，你可以认为是对无法自产的“维生素M”（Monument） 的绝对需求在强行驱使你与人共存，产生人类内部最基本的聚合力。", "char_start": 1234, "char_end": 1300}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "而父母、亲眷，是自然法为每个人指定的纪念者。", "char_start": 1301, "char_end": 1323}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "这也是为什么即使没有婚姻制度从经济、政治上做担保，人类也不太可能用大量的短期情爱关系来替代长期稳定的恋人 / 配偶—— 因为前者不产生纪念。", "char_start": 1324, "char_end": 1394}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "回到父母。", "char_start": 1395, "char_end": 1400}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "为什么如此详细的解释纪念的重要意义？", "char_start": 1401, "char_end": 1419}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "因为归根到底，人的行为方式的形成几乎最终都是来自对自己所拥有的纪念的不断反刍。", "char_start": 1420, "char_end": 1459}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "第一次失败、第一次夺冠、第一次交到朋友、第一次被背叛、第一次表白、第一次被拒、第一次亲吻、第一次做爱、第一次被赏识、第一次被憎恨……这些印刻在骨髓里的记忆本身所附带的情节记忆和对其前因后果的一生连绵不断的咀嚼和反思，从根本意义上型塑了人自身的思维方式和行为逻辑。", "char_start": 1460, "char_end": 1591}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "因此，身为父母、亲眷、朋友，你对你所眷顾的人的最大的爱的实践之一，就是帮ta建立和守住纪念。", "char_start": 1592, "char_end": 1638}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "抓住那根你想替ta留住的丝线，把线头打上一个结，然后不断的担任这个结存在的见证。对这个结的记忆和不断的反思，就会影响ta的一生。", "char_start": 1639, "char_end": 1703}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "不是你对ta的所谓“教导”，而是ta自己对这件事的不断的反刍和消化，最后凝结成ta的自我教育。", "char_start": 1704, "char_end": 1751}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "你能做的最重要、最有效的努力，其实不在教导部分，而在于替ta留下将来不断反刍的原料基础和诱因。", "char_start": 1752, "char_end": 1799}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "上面所有的解释，最后都汇聚成一个这样的方法：", "char_start": 1800, "char_end": 1822}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "你要把ta承担某种责任的英勇行为诚实的、郑重的记录下来，留下格式完备、形式坚固、礼仪严谨的纪念。", "char_start": 1823, "char_end": 1871}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "1）它应该留下一份文字的或影音的记录，并被很好的、严密的保存着，哪怕家里遭受火灾也不可能丢失。", "char_start": 1872, "char_end": 1919}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "2）它应该有一个日常可见的表征物——哪怕是手镯上的一条刻痕、门框上的一个记号。（因为这个原因，印第安人要求少年佩戴第一头被猎获的狼的牙齿）", "char_start": 1920, "char_end": 1989}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "3）它应该有一个会被回顾的制度——如同那些宗教节日会回顾相关的事迹。", "char_start": 1990, "char_end": 2024}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "你于某年某月某日，第一次承担了xx责任。", "char_start": 2025, "char_end": 2045}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "其事如下：", "char_start": 2046, "char_end": 2051}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "xxxxxxxxx", "char_start": 2052, "char_end": 2061}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "其证如下：", "char_start": 2062, "char_end": 2067}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "xxxxxxx", "char_start": 2068, "char_end": 2075}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "你父xxx，你母xxx，谨以此记，永为纪念。", "char_start": 2076, "char_end": 2098}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "以后每逢生日，固定的内容就是把这些信物拿出来回顾。", "char_start": 2099, "char_end": 2124}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "第一，不管你当时的教导是什么，这时你都有机会再次更正和重新审视；也不管ta当时理解了多少，这时ta都会再想到更多。", "char_start": 2125, "char_end": 2182}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "第二，ta永远有足够真实的依据，斩钉截铁的相信父母对自己的关切。没有任何人可以以任何形式告诉ta“父母不关心我”，包括ta自己在内。", "char_start": 2183, "char_end": 2249}, {"paragraph_id": "P048", "field": "body", "index": 48, "text": "因为“代为纪念”，是一种注定沉重的负担，是以自己的生命担任对方生命的定锚，这是一种无可否决的爱。", "char_start": 2250, "char_end": 2298}, {"paragraph_id": "P049", "field": "body", "index": 49, "text": "第三，你已经为你的子女积淀了父母所能赠予的“维生素M”，这个储备，足以极大的缓解子女将来的存在感危机——甚至有机会直接帮ta免疫。", "char_start": 2299, "char_end": 2364}, {"paragraph_id": "P050", "field": "body", "index": 50, "text": "其实你经常听到子女、配偶渴求“陪伴”，ta们真正痛苦纠结的并不是——或至少不仅是——共处的时间少，而是指ta们发现自己的生命里几乎没有你所建立的纪念。如果你花费大量的时间仅仅只是存在于ta们身边，却同样没有产生这样的纪念，你就仍然会受困于这种抱怨，这原因就在于此。", "char_start": 2365, "char_end": 2497}, {"paragraph_id": "P051", "field": "body", "index": 51, "text": "陪伴只是“事”，纪念才是“功”，人所行的，有事半功倍，亦有事倍功半，你明白了没有？", "char_start": 2498, "char_end": 2539}, {"paragraph_id": "P052", "field": "body", "index": 52, "text": "纪念本身就是最大的奖赏，而非儿童乐园和冰激凌。", "char_start": 2540, "char_end": 2563}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 51, "heading": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0367"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何教导子女理解责任、分辨责任的归属和怎样承担属于自己的责任？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047", "P048", "P049", "P050", "P051", "P052"], "summary": "围绕“维生素M”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这个问题问得实在太“巨大”，按理说不应该采纳的。它实际上应该被分解为至少四个问题，即“何谓责任”“如何分辨责任的归属”“怎样承担属于自己的责任”以及“如何更好的对子女进行上述教导”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这个问题问得实在太“巨大”，按理说不应该采纳的。它实际上应该被分解为至少四个问题，即“何谓责任”“如何分辨责任的归属”“怎样承担属于自己的责任”以及“如何更好的对子女进行上述教导”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 91, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "77b5039d-9216-54d9-bbfc-53f89d993681", "source_ordinal": 1552, "reading_ordinal": 2505, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "不配得", "published_at": "2024-06-05T10:48:59+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/374996692/answer/3520703730"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这实际上是一个“觉得收入不可持续”的问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "答案当然是注意不要让自己的生活水平过度提高，也不要做需要很大投入的大投资。", "char_start": 22, "char_end": 59}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "现有的收入是不稳固的，具有偶然性，你也不必急着终止它，但是只要你没有因此扩张自己的生活胃口，那么“我仍然足够简朴”这个事实本身就足以很大程度的安慰你。", "char_start": 60, "char_end": 135}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你一天花200，拿到了一份一天收入1000的报酬，觉得自己不值，只要你还是保持着200元/天的生活水平，那么这多赚的五六百对你就是纯天上掉馅饼。", "char_start": 136, "char_end": 208}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "就算你不值这个价，这份好运气的好处你也攒下来了，慌啥？", "char_start": 209, "char_end": 236}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "就怕你一边觉得自己不值，一边学会了一天花600。那时候这个“不值”感就会变成一种“前途莫测”的恐惧。", "char_start": 237, "char_end": 287}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "其实“值不值这个价”确实主要看你对能l保持这个收入有没有稳固的自信。而这个自信主要要靠市场调研，而不是靠慌不慌。", "char_start": 288, "char_end": 344}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你可以多跟同地位的同行，或者与你的岗位的合作岗位的同事多交流，摸摸处在你这个职位的人一般是个什么水平，看看跟你的差距有多少，如果你发现差距不大，那你也不用纠结了。差距大，那就赶紧去追赶差距。", "char_start": 345, "char_end": 440}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "追平了你也不需要担忧了。", "char_start": 441, "char_end": 453}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 9}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0367"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：觉得自己干的活不值得那么高薪水怎么办？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009"], "summary": "围绕“不配得”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这实际上是一个“觉得收入不可持续”的问题。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这实际上是一个“觉得收入不可持续”的问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "dc1f971c-f638-5654-a3bb-55d5e8d93cb4", "source_ordinal": 1551, "reading_ordinal": 2506, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "建议合理的生活", "published_at": "2024-06-05T11:15:12+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/657210929/answer/3520739385"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "卫生棉条的设计有这么失败吗？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "换导管型呗。", "char_start": 15, "char_end": 21}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "亲近不亲近，这是个人私事，由不得外人来干预和评判，也没必要有啥大惊小怪。", "char_start": 22, "char_end": 58}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "但是产品说明书建议仔细阅读，不要辜负了工业文明。", "char_start": 59, "char_end": 83}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "想了想，这个问题要说全一点，因为这背后的议题其实很深。", "char_start": 85, "char_end": 112}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "那就是不要要求人规范的生活，而要建议人合理的生活。这两者之间是有重大的差异的。", "char_start": 113, "char_end": 152}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "何谓“要求人规范地生活”？", "char_start": 153, "char_end": 166}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "就是首先设定一个“我认为所有人都应该遵守的规矩、标准样式”，公布为国标、部标、族标，要求治下之人照此办理。如不照办，轻则口头批评，重则追究刑事责任。", "char_start": 167, "char_end": 241}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "何谓“建议人合理地生活”？", "char_start": 243, "char_end": 256}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "就是首先不设立某个标准的活法，仅仅从“你现在的活法可能适应不了某种客观挑战”出发，给你“达成可持续的最小幅修正”的建议。", "char_start": 257, "char_end": 317}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "举个例子，某甲爱裸睡。", "char_start": 319, "char_end": 330}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "“要求人规范生活”的起点就是“谁会裸睡？大家都不裸睡你为啥裸睡？我都不裸睡你凭啥裸睡？”，然后批评裸睡的人不道德、挑战公共道德和传统风俗等等。", "char_start": 331, "char_end": 402}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "而“建议人合理生活”考虑的是，建议卧室搞好恒温以免晚上温度变化容易生病；建议门口玄关做一下特殊设计或者准备一披就得的睡袍，这样晚上接外卖免得穿衣服麻烦；建议家里搞点特别的安全措施，以免万一家里进贼影响战斗力……", "char_start": 403, "char_end": 508}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你其实仍然可以“反对”对方的行为，但这个反对不是从道德、规范、社会秩序这个角度去考虑问题，而是从具体技术细节上以“补全”的思路去讨论具体的实施。", "char_start": 509, "char_end": 581}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "后者也可能产生很尖锐的反对，例如“爱摸高压电”、“爱犯法”，显然会比“爱裸睡”得到更焦虑的建议。", "char_start": 582, "char_end": 630}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "但总体而言，除非涉及到明确的法律法规、合同契约问题，永远不要以个人身份对另一个人走前一条路线去做干预。", "char_start": 631, "char_end": 682}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "走前一条路线是有资格权柄的门槛的，你必须先有某种天授（例如生为其父母）或者对方自己授予（例如跟你签约加入你的团队）的管理权，否则走前一条路即为僭越和冒犯。", "char_start": 683, "char_end": 760}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "无论你说什么内容，都只会结怨而不是产生好的结果。", "char_start": 761, "char_end": 785}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 21}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0367"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：朋友的男闺蜜帮她塞卫生棉条，这关系是不是太过于亲近了？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018"], "summary": "围绕“建议合理的生活”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“卫生棉条的设计有这么失败吗？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "卫生棉条的设计有这么失败吗？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
